  "releaseNotes": "New OverlayScrollbars (default off): the scrollbars lie over the text and take no room, at the bottom the last line stays above the horizontal scrollbar. The horizontal scrollbar becomes active only when the longest line does not fit and scrolls only to its end. Redraw when the window gets wider while scrolled to the right. LineNumberGap 8 instead of 16 by default.",
